## Finding things in this codebase

This repo has a structural index at `.codesearch/index.db`, refreshed at
session start. Query it instead of reading files to orient yourself:

    python3 tools/codesearch/codesearch.py search "<question>"
    python3 tools/codesearch/codesearch.py refs <symbol>    # blast radius
    python3 tools/codesearch/codesearch.py show <path>:<a>-<b>

Run `/codesearch` for the full retrieval ladder. For anything spanning several
files, delegate to the `codebase-researcher` agent so the search stays out of
this conversation.
